<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's Solidere mixed on official bourse.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's Solidere mixed on official bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on Tuesday as A shares fell slightly to $ 112.875 from Monday's $113.625 and B shares were unchanged at $116.75.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares on the Beirut Stock Exchange (BSE) rose to 9,805 shares from 8,017 on Monday and value was $1,120,050 from $914,336.</p>
<p>Also traded were 100 shares of piping maker Eternit at $1.6875, up from $1.625 on Monday.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index rose 0.45 percent to 82.82 and the BLOM stock index fell 0.22 percent to 972.72.</p>
<p>-- Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
